<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company results expected in week ending February 28 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS FRIDAY, February 28</p>
<p>- no major companies reporting</p>
<p>*** Net profits including special items before dividend on preference shares, special credit are expected to be between 20 million stg and 25 million stg.</p>
<p>**** Net adjusted earnings. Figures in US dollars.</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>THURSDAY, 6 March Royal Sun ***     F	  PFT	 859.3  828.0-926.0   1040.0</p>
