<p>- No major companies reporting NOTES bb - these pretax figures are in billions stg ## - The Cadbury forecasts exclude a 40 million stg restructuring</p>
<p>charge ** - T&amp;N's forecasts exclude an exceptional charge of</p>
<p>465 million stg *** - The RSA forecasts exclude merger costs of 170 million stg **** - The Rolls Royce forecasts exclude a H1 exceptional</p>
